    {
      "step": 1,
      "title": "",
      "text": "In a bowl or meal prep jar, combine rolled oats, protein powder, and a pinch of salt."
    },
    {
      "step": 2,
      "title": "",
      "text": "Pour in the almond milk or water and stir thoroughly until no lumps remain."
